THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES
========================

setpoint declares its runtime dependencies in pyproject.toml. They are installed
from their own distributions and ship their own licenses; none of their source is
vendored into this repository.

nvidia-ml-py
    NVIDIA Management Library Python bindings.
    Copyright NVIDIA Corporation. BSD-3-Clause.


DEVELOPMENT DEPENDENCIES
========================

Used by the test suite only. Not installed with setpoint and not shipped with it.

gguf
    Reference GGUF reader and writer. MIT. The test suite writes sample files with it
    and checks setpoint's own GGUF reader against it.
